# no need, please see comment: https://github.com/dotnet/macios/pull/4251#issuecomment-410815837
!missing-pinvoke! nw_release is not bound
!missing-pinvoke! nw_retain is not bound

## xcode 10.0 backlog
!missing-pinvoke! nw_endpoint_get_address is not bound

## no documentation from apple. So we do nothing, specially with the _ prefix. Leak?
!missing-field! _nw_data_transfer_report_all_paths not bound

# updated sharpie results
!missing-enum! nw_browser_state_t not bound

## nw_link_quality_t - changing the backing type from uint to byte is a breaking change; fixed in XAMCORE_5_0
!wrong-enum-size! nw_link_quality_t managed 4 vs native 1

## NWParametersAttribution has a 32-bit backing type; changing it would break binary compatibility.
!wrong-enum-size! nw_parameters_attribution_t managed 4 vs native 1

## Preserve existing NWIPVersion values; correcting these values is a separate behavioral change.
!missing-enum-value! NWIPVersion native value nw_ip_version_4 = 4 not bound
!missing-enum-value! NWIPVersion native value nw_ip_version_6 = 6 not bound
!extra-enum-value! Managed value 1 for NWIPVersion.Version4 not found in native headers
!extra-enum-value! Managed value 2 for NWIPVersion.Version6 not found in native headers

## NWFramerStartResult.Unknown is an additional managed sentinel.
!extra-enum-value! Managed value 0 for NWFramerStartResult.Unknown not found in native headers

## Newly detected missing value; adding enum members is outside the native-name correction.
!missing-enum-value! NWPathUnsatisfiedReason native value nw_path_unsatisfied_reason_vpn_inactive = 4 not bound
